    "These later bounded results do not turn the earlier dated 52-component audit into 52 full end-to-end passes. Individual scopes below remain authoritative.",
    "Three failed attempts remain: file-protocol navigation rejection, implicit archive auto-start message failure and archive restart-lock failure. Successful recovery does not erase them.",
    "Playwright used an existing Chrome installation and a fixture-only loopback HTTP endpoint. Its Playwright dependencies are alpha builds; no default browser download or arbitrary-site acceptance was tested.",
    "The archive was restricted to one explicit project session. Full private transcripts, authentication material and session identifiers are omitted; automatic archive discovery did not pass.",
    "HUD acceptance is a synthetic renderer fixture, not a live interactive account display. OpenResearch acceptance is public-paper retrieval, not an agent research workflow or research-quality assessment.",
    "The ccusage reports overlap and must not be added. Upstream parser categories and totals are not bills or a matched provider savings comparison. The first date-only query returned an empty window.",
    "The bridge trial is additional observed provider usage, not savings. It used one backend task without an outer Claude interaction or matched baseline; cached input is a subset of native input.",
    "Tracked source remained unchanged; native MCP startup created untracked metadata. All owned temporary services were stopped. Public aggregate hashes bind retained evidence but do not independently reproduce private logs."
  ],
